          "script": "\t\n\tdbConnection \u003d self.view.custom.dbConnection\n\treasonTable \u003d mes_core.model.statereasonTable(dbConnection)\n\treasonID \u003d self.getChild(\"FlexContainer\").getChild(\"FlexContainer_new\").getChild(\"Dashboard\").props.widgets[6].viewParams.selected\n\tnote \u003d self.getChild(\"FlexContainer\").getChild(\"FlexContainer_new\").getChild(\"Dashboard\").props.widgets[1].viewParams.contend \n\treason \u003d reasonTable.selectID(statereason_id \u003d reasonID, columns \u003d [\u0027ReasonName\u0027,\u0027ReasonCode\u0027])\n\treasonName \u003d reason.getValueAt(0,0)\n\treasonCode \u003d reason.getValueAt(0,1)\n\treasonHistoryTable \u003d mes_core.model.statehistoryTable(dbConnection)\n\teventID \u003d self.view.params.old.eventID\n\treasonHistoryTable.updateID(eventID,{\u0027reasonName\u0027:reasonName,\u0027reasonCode\u0027:reasonCode,\u0027stateReasonID\u0027:reasonID,\u0027note\u0027:note})\n\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027eventEdit\u0027)\n\tsystem.perspective.closePopup(\u0027eventDetails\u0027)\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027updatedDataTable\u0027)\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027getDownTimeEvents\u0027)\n\talerts.actionSuccess(title\u003d\u0027Evento editado\u0027, \n\t\t\t\t\t\tmessage\u003d\u0027Evento {} editado correctamente\u0027.format(eventID))",
